    {
      "id": "claim_626d1406a4204a53b06fe3023c92ce2a",
      "statement": "Each actor event is applied through drive, which executes the returned effects, arms timers, and pushes immediate follow-up events until the queue empties, then validates core invariants in debug builds.",
